invite.text:
Hello {name},
You now have a {role} account at {clinic}.

1. Install the app: {download}
2. On the sign-in screen choose “Connect to clinic server” and enter: {server}
3. Sign in with
   Email: {email}
   Temporary password: {password}

You will be asked to choose your own password.

invite.textNoServer:
Hello {name},
You now have a {role} account at {clinic}.
Sign in on the clinic computer with
   Email: {email}
   Temporary password: {password}

You will be asked to choose your own password.
